{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02832","headline":"哭明堂裴主簿 · 卢照邻","name":"哭明堂裴主簿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"缔欢三十载，通家数百年。\n潘杨称代穆，秦晋忝姻连。\n风云洛阳道，花月茂陵田。\n相悲共相乐，交骑复交筵。\n始谓调金鼎，如何掩玉泉。\n黄公酒鑪处，青眼竹林前。\n故琴无复雪，新树但生烟。\n遽痛兰襟断，徒令宝剑悬。\n客散同秋叶，人亡似夜川。\n送君一长恸，松台路几千。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢照邻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02832.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02832","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}